        "id": 2439700382,
        "content": "I just had pretty much the same error minus \"skipping plugin\" if it's anything like mine it's your `app_private_key`, mine was a cf worker log error and was due to me not replacing `\\n` for a separate plugin.\r\nLocal dev requires your private key be a single string using `\\n` which is how it's generated I'm certain. But for other places like github secrets and cloudflare secrets replace `\\n` with a literal line break and don't wrap it in quotes. afaik",
